herdr-pane-labels
Copyright 2026 kiote

mods/pane-labels is a modified copy of the `pane` mod of herdr-app
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, defaults/mods/pane, version 0.1.12),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Its icons (close, split-down,
split-right, unzoom, zoom) come from the same folder.

Changes: the header shows the value of the terminal label `pane.title`
(else `dashboard.title`) after the agent's name; asset paths point to
mods/pane-labels.

